{
  "name": "12 · Complaint Summariser (Kaamchor AI · MAP 3.0)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 12 · Complaint Summariser\nEvery complaint on WhatsApp or email becomes a **ticket row** with a one-line AI summary, category and priority. **High-priority or angry** complaints: the owner gets a WhatsApp alert and NO auto-reply goes out. Normal ones get a polite fixed acknowledgement (email = Gmail draft only).\n\n**Setup (15 min)**\n1. WhatsApp nodes: add a **WhatsApp Business Cloud API** credential and replace YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID with your Phone Number ID (Meta → WhatsApp → API setup).\n2. Gmail nodes: add a **Gmail OAuth2** credential. Edit the search words in **New email** if you like.\n3. Google Sheets nodes: add a **Google Sheets OAuth2** credential and paste your sheet link in place of YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL. Tab **Tickets**: Ticket ID, Received, Channel, Name, Contact, Category, Priority, Angry, Order ref, Summary, Message, Status, Subject, Thread.\n4. Replace YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP with the owner's WhatsApp number in 91XXXXXXXXXX format.\n5. AI model node: add an **Anthropic** credential (or swap the model node for OpenAI / Gemini).\n\nThe AI never writes replies to customers here, it only reads and sorts.",
        "height": 721,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 1
      },
      "id": "18586469-364d-4856-88cf-e6589d12aa29",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -480,
        -260
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "id": "b51c654e-de4c-43d5-bfc9-220edabde2f4",
      "name": "WhatsApp message",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "in:inbox (complaint OR problem OR issue OR refund OR damaged OR \"not working\" OR late)"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "6e1e21ed-6309-4f31-8e65-53d0792a1b7c",
      "name": "New email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return { json: { channel: 'whatsapp', name: $json.contacts?.[0]?.profile?.name || '', contact: $json.messages?.[0]?.from,\n  subject: '', text: $json.messages?.[0]?.text?.body || '' } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "1455d371-d1de-4438-8dae-632663177db3",
      "name": "From WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        -120
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return { json: { channel: 'email', name: $json.from?.value?.[0]?.name || '', contact: $json.from?.value?.[0]?.address || '',\n  subject: $json.subject || '', text: String($json.text || '').slice(0, 4000), threadId: $json.threadId } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "8cce2f8b-bdf1-4ae8-a0ba-571c68a67816",
      "name": "From email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=A customer of YOUR BUSINESS NAME wrote to us on {{ $json.channel }}.\nName: {{ $json.name }}\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nMessage: \"{{ $json.text }}\"\n\nis_complaint: true only if they report a problem with a product, order, delivery, bill, service or staff.\nsummary: one line for the owner (what happened, what they want). category: product | delivery | billing | service | staff | other.\npriority: high (money lost, safety, legal threat, repeated problem, very angry, public review threat) | medium | low.\nangry: true if the tone is angry or threatening. order_ref: order / bill number if they gave one, else ''.\nDo not write any reply to the customer.",
        "hasOutputParser": true
      },
      "id": "58ce0c41-38d3-41c1-a45b-e7bb1185d175",
      "name": "AI reads complaint",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        480,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "claude-sonnet-5-5",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {
          "temperature": 0.2
        }
      },
      "id": "4f664c87-b258-4858-a425-6811812b1130",
      "name": "AI model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatAnthropic",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        420,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsonSchemaExample": "{\n  \"is_complaint\": true,\n  \"summary\": \"AC service done on 24 Oct, cooling stopped again, wants revisit\",\n  \"category\": \"service\",\n  \"priority\": \"high\",\n  \"angry\": true,\n  \"order_ref\": \"JOB-1182\"\n}"
      },
      "id": "2c06ca33-b6ec-466f-a543-79e2ef7a6a30",
      "name": "JSON shape",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.outputParserStructured",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        620,
        220
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.output.is_complaint }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7f3ddbc7-c8bc-41b3-b6b4-1b14babe6837",
      "name": "Is a complaint?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        860,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const pick = n => { try { return $(n).item.json; } catch (e) { return null; } };\nconst msg = pick('From WhatsApp') || pick('From email') || {};\nconst o = $json.output;\nconst id = 'T-' + $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyLLdd-HHmm') + '-' + String($itemIndex + 1);\nreturn { json: { 'Ticket ID': id, Received: $now.setZone('Asia/Kolkata').toFormat('yyyy-LL-dd HH:mm'), Channel: msg.channel, Name: msg.name, Contact: msg.contact,\n  Category: o.category, Priority: o.priority, Angry: o.angry ? 'yes' : 'no', 'Order ref': o.order_ref, Summary: o.summary, Message: msg.text, Status: 'open',\n  Subject: msg.subject, Thread: msg.threadId || '' } };",
        "mode": "runOnceForEachItem"
      },
      "id": "df6aa729-4824-4243-bf74-974ab0f2f75a",
      "name": "Ticket row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1100,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "append",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "url",
          "value": "YOUR_GOOGLE_SHEET_URL"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "name",
          "value": "Tickets"
        },
        "columns": {
          "mappingMode": "autoMapInputData",
          "value": {},
          "matchingColumns": [],
          "schema": []
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "2a01007e-f498-4a9b-9316-77718d3b78ba",
      "name": "Tickets sheet",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1340,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Priority === 'high' || $('Ticket row').item.json.Angry === 'yes' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a815b6b5-bc34-4594-ba74-af074268dd9a",
      "name": "High or angry?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1580,
        -80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "=YOUR_OWNER_WHATSAPP",
        "textBody": "=🚨 {{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Priority.toUpperCase() }} complaint {{ $('Ticket row').item.json['Ticket ID'] }} ({{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Channel }})\n{{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Name }} · {{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Contact }}\n{{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Summary }}\nNo auto-reply sent. Please reply personally.",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "b9480a63-a342-40a5-bbc4-35f6ab2894c5",
      "name": "Alert owner (no auto-reply)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1820,
        -200
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Channel === 'whatsapp' }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "3f3820c8-1422-43ba-9f5e-7d96ba94cb6e",
      "name": "Came on WhatsApp?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1820,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "message",
        "operation": "send",
        "phoneNumberId": "YOUR_PHONE_NUMBER_ID",
        "recipientPhoneNumber": "={{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Contact }}",
        "textBody": "=Hello {{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Name }} ji, sorry for the trouble. We have noted it as ticket *{{ $('Ticket row').item.json['Ticket ID'] }}*. Our team will check and get back to you within 24 hours. – YOUR BUSINESS NAME",
        "additionalFields": {}
      },
      "id": "f16ba0e0-5f09-4783-9616-b5a5edb2af66",
      "name": "Acknowledge on WhatsApp",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsApp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        -40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "draft",
        "subject": "=Re: {{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Subject }}",
        "message": "=Hello {{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Name }} ji,\n\nSorry for the trouble. We have noted this as ticket {{ $('Ticket row').item.json['Ticket ID'] }}. Our team will check and reply within 24 hours.\n\nYOUR BUSINESS NAME",
        "options": {
          "sendTo": "={{ $('Ticket row').item.json.Contact }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "5eec2e4c-948c-4042-aac1-f3b9e2876b56",
      "name": "Acknowledge email (draft)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        2060,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
